1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,120
Alice: Good morning
everyone.

2
00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:03,200
Let's start the
weekly sync.

3
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:06,000
Dumindu: ආයුබෝවන්, අද රැස්වීමේ කාර්ය
සූචිය බලමු.

4
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:08,000
මම හොඳින්, ස්තුතියි.

5
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:10,744
Alice: The quarterly
numbers look good,

6
00:00:10,824 --> 00:00:12,596
but we need to
improve the Sinhala

7
00:00:12,676 --> 00:00:13,126
transcription
accuracy,

8
00:00:13,206 --> 00:00:14,206
especially for
names.

9
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:16,541
Dumindu: Agreed. I'll review
the rules with Zoom

10
00:00:16,621 --> 00:00:18,000
& Teams <beta> next
week.

11
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:27,020
Alice: After a long pause:
a quote "hello",

12
00:00:27,100 --> 00:00:28,100
and a comma.

